{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act42side_level_act42side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act42side",
  "stageId": "act42side_07",
  "title": "喪禮",
  "storyCode": "MT-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "860bfe9aab603429ce452cd3b1ea5e4e55fe654926654f3d892e28050641e030",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兩位，就是這裡了，請稍作休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我以為，配合調查阿爾圖羅小姐越獄的事情，應該要去公證所或者大教堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帶領二位來的銃騎有事先走了。他託我轉告二位，請不用擔心阿爾圖羅的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一直以來，蘭登修道院的各位都在盡責盡職地守護聖城，我們不會因為一個犯人越獄，就過多苛責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼，那就好那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們請兩位來，是有別的事情要商量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡好多——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您希望換個安靜點的地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我的意思是，這間育嬰室裡……為什麼全是黎博利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "席德佳看向前方，著裝各異的黎博利們或站或坐，沒多少人說話，唯有安撫鈴的聲音穩定地響著。\n幾百？成千？上萬？席德佳數不清了，或許一整個城市的黎博利都在眼前。\n這間育嬰室有這麼大嗎？不，怎樣的場合，需要聚集如此多的黎博利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "保育員先生，你們是不是還有一間房裡全是佩洛、一間房裡全是菲林、一間房裡全是魯珀……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您很聰明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們也為墮天使和薩卡茲準備了專門的房間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……呃，您很坦然嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟育嬰聖堂並沒有在做什麼見不得人的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "降生儀式的最後，教皇廳已經宣布，薩科塔將向所有種族分享光環。以種族為單位執行起來是最方便的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎博利公民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "保育員先生，你是說，我們真的也能擁有光環？也能像薩科塔那樣互相感受？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "正如您在降生儀式上感受那隻小木攀獸的心跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說，我為什麼，要擁有光環呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以說，把我帶到這裡，壓根不是為了梵里妮的事情，而是因為……我是個黎博利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很快，我也能擁有你頭頂上的這圈日光燈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "進去吧，潘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喲，看來我沒有拒絕的權利啊。而且，聽起來是一件大好事，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "起碼對你的眼睛有好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還不只這樣吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要是當初我有光環，是不是就能知道你把吉雅趕出拉特蘭的時候，你那鐵皮腦袋底下是什麼心情了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道你埋怨我，潘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很有自知之明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果沒發生那件事，你或許不會淪落到如今的地步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拉特蘭千百年的歷史上，有很多人嘗試過還原典籍中描述的那把恐怖的大口徑轉管遺產銃……成功的只有你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那種認定使用者能承受遠超常規銃械五倍後座力的設計，真是天才又瘋癲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，你在沒穿戴銃騎甲胄之前，就成功試驗了我的設計，你是在變相誇自己是天生的銃騎嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我當時只覺得自己是你天生的搭檔。你、我、吉雅，從小學到大學，我們一直都是最好的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我正式成為銃騎的第一項任務，卻是把吉雅驅逐出拉特蘭……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在那之後，你辭去了銃騎專屬製銃師的職務，在我不知道的地方開了一家小工坊，如今又……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是自願退休的，行不行？*拉特蘭俚語*的“製銃聖堂”，要是你們薩科塔都把製銃當作生產洋芋片，那我為什麼還要插手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是薩科塔有罪，是嗎？吉雅要被趕出去，我要被套上光環……就沒有黎博利能在拉特蘭好好活著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那件事和吉雅是不是黎博利沒有關係。哪怕她是薩科塔，她感染了礦石病，拉特蘭也不容——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道個屁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不就是什麼“拉特蘭的秩序”、“拉特蘭的純潔”嗎？這些話我從你嘴裡聽過多少次了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但這話你自己信嗎？你想想吉雅是怎麼一個人死在外面的？你*拉特蘭俚語*信嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我承認，我自己曾經相信。直到那個時候，帕特里奇昂……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們曾一起宿醉，一起玩銃，一起哭一起笑，我們自詡全拉特蘭沒有人的酒杯碰得比我們的響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但直到吉雅的背影消失在荒野盡頭，你就那麼從我旁邊轉身回拉特蘭的時候，我才意識到……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們從來沒有真正交流過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "席德佳修女，光環並不是惡物，它是拉特蘭對我們的賜福。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從最初循著馱獸而來的流民開始，黎博利就始終在向薩科塔學習，從生活習慣到思考方式，無所不學。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黎博利嚮往美好的生活，也渴望成為聖城的一部分，我們有目共睹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不久前，我才剛和阿爾圖羅小姐講過這段歷史。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但唯有薩科塔頭頂上的光環，黎博利怎麼都無法習得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也正因為如此，一直以來，薩科塔與生活在拉特蘭的其他種族之間，始終都存在一些無法調和的矛盾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們無從參與薩科塔的共感，你們會苦惱自己的信仰是否毫無根基，你們會質疑拉特蘭的冷漠與疏離……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "席德佳修女，您此前為了解決蘭登修道院的財務危機，常年不在拉特蘭，所以對這種情況缺乏一些認知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您可以再去問問其他的黎博利……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道在這裡生活的很多異族人都羡慕你們的共感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以接下來，我們將向每一個人分享它。它會讓我們不再有誤會、不再有分歧，讓我們真正理解彼此，消弭矛盾和隔閡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓黎博利，真正成為拉特蘭不可分割的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只覺得難過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我從小在這座城市長大，知道哪家店做的甜點不甜，哪條巷子的流浪雲獸愛吃南瓜，哪棟樓的天台適合看星星。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在蘭登修道院的日子，我和薩科塔修女們一起釀啤酒做麵包，分頭跑到其他國家拉贊助，又在回來聚會的時候喝得酩酊大醉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我偷拍她們睡覺時翅膀穿過椅背的滑稽樣子，她們在我偷溜出去的時候在教堂裡放安眠曲，好讓主教睡得更久一點……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，席德佳，我還記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "緊張的修女",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實主教早就發現了，他只是捨不得責怪你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "保育員先生，我是個拉特蘭人。我很喜歡這裡，很喜歡很喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您說得沒錯，我確實很多時候都發現自己在狀況外，我不懂為什麼在同僚的葬禮上，薩科塔們哭著哭著就笑著唱起了歌……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我爸爸是個獵戶，每年冬天，他都會和其他人結伴，進山打獵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他告訴我，哪怕是相處了十幾年的老夥伴，也會在發現同一個獵物時有不同的意見，甚至吵起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人和人本來就是不一樣的，這和我們有沒有光環沒有關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是您剛剛跟我說，我要獲得光環，才能真正成為拉特蘭的一分子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您是在說，我過去二十多年，都不算是一個真正的拉特蘭人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是在說，我所有的生活，都只是一種不夠完美的模仿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "確實如此，席德佳修女，但這並不是對您或其他任何黎博利的否定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這只是一種必要的，對拉特蘭的肯定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "保育員先生，我不在乎什麼否定和肯定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是不覺得我和我的生活有什麼錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "更不覺得自己有什麼理由要接受這種所謂的“賜福”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是拉特蘭的決定，席德佳修女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是我第一次感受到離別的滋味，潘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……十分難受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，從那時開始，我的人生就開始不對勁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像那種爆米花電影，哈哈，《電鋸俠》系列，或者《藍橋遺夢》系列，一個橋段成了經典，開始反反覆覆地出現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "吉雅之後是你，再後來是我最器重的學生，基於某些原因，我親手將她驅逐出拉特蘭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有小菲，也讓人很頭痛……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼？你還擔心哪天你的孫女跑了，自己變成孤寡老人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們有各自的問題，我嘗試過做些什麼，但好像什麼都做不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你那是嘗試，還是自我欺騙、自我安慰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許都是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過你剛剛說錯了一件事，希望每一個人都擁有光環，並不僅僅是為了守護所謂“聖城的秩序和純潔”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這說得好像拉特蘭是個有種族潔癖的國家一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "共享光環的拉特蘭，將成為一個真正的整體，連某種無從想像的、威脅全泰拉的災厄都能夠解決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那樣的拉特蘭，自然也能夠解決我們所遭遇的一切問題，包括……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，談心時間結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*拉特蘭俚語*，你終於說完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又一次從你嘴裡聽到這些鬼話，真噁心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潘，進去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我拒絕呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我才不想要你頭頂那個發光的東西，我對理解你的苦心一點興趣都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "潘格尼尼向銃騎舉起了自己手中的銃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再等等吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我承認你是個天才的製銃師，但你是個黎博利，潘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你沒辦法使用自己親手打造的這些銃。它們在你手裡，只是一張張名片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你真的對我那麼不滿，真的想要賞我一顆子彈，你就應該等到儀式結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到了那時，你擁有了光環，也就擁有了使用它的資格——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "潘格尼尼重重地將銃砸在銃騎的甲胄上，碎屑紛飛，斷裂的銃托摔了出去，沉悶的嗡響自遠處傳來，在走廊裡久久迴盪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕特里奇昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潘，進去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萬國信使莫斯提馬、“監管人”菲亞梅塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兩位辛苦了，感謝兩位為拉特蘭的付出。現在，請移駕……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "移駕到那些已經塞滿人的育嬰室？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "儀式很快就要開始了，牧首將率先為在拉特蘭棲居已久的黎博利啟聖。之後，墮天使破碎的光環與光翼也將得到修補。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保育員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還請兩位儘快動身，我會為兩位引路……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
